# Best Practices

- Keep the agent focused on one business role.
- Use clear, detailed instructions.
- Connect only trusted enterprise knowledge sources.
- Write conversation starters that reflect common business questions.
- Regularly review and update the agent's instructions and knowledge sources.
- Ensure appropriate permissions and data governance are applied.

---

# Governance Considerations

Before deploying Declarative Agents, organizations should define:

- Data access permissions
- Responsible AI policies
- Content ownership
- Information lifecycle management
- Security and compliance controls
- Periodic review of agent instructions and knowledge sources

---

