---

# Key Takeaways

- Declarative Agents provide role-specific AI assistants grounded in enterprise knowledge.
- Well-defined instructions and curated knowledge sources produce higher-quality responses.
- Agents improve executive productivity by reducing time spent searching for information.
- Governance, security, and Responsible AI practices remain essential when deploying organizational agents.
- Declarative Agents complement—not replace—executive judgment and decision-making.

